                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1163/62: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the State
                        to the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-10-05T20:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 5,
                                1926—8 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>218. Tour 453, October 5, 10 a.m. Your recommendation approved. Five hundred
                    dollars allowance granted. Draw on Secretary of State. Render separate
                    account.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
